<title>USA: Redbook sales said up 2.5-2.8 pct w/e Feb 22.</title>
<headline>Redbook sales said up 2.5-2.8 pct w/e Feb 22.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Redbook Retail Sales Index is expected to rise between 2.5 and 2.8 percent in the period ending February 22 after the 2.8 percent rise reported last week, according to market sources.</p>
<p>Lynch, Jones &amp; Ryan Inc will report the Redbook Index on Tuesday at 1455 EST/1955 GMT.</p>
<p>((-- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660))</p>
